  Object.assign(text, {"Os valores iniciais servem para explorar a ideia e podem ser editados. O espaco para trabalhar faz parte do bar: nao ha passes, aluguer de postos ou mensalidades.": "Starting values are editable placeholders. The work area is part of the bar: there are no passes, desk rentals or subscriptions.", "Receita = consumo por visita. Os clientes a trabalhar nao entram novamente no publico externo.": "Revenue means spend per visit. Working customers are not counted again as external customers.", "Ano 1 / horizonte da concessao": "Year 1 / concession horizon", "INVESTIMENTO TOTAL": "TOTAL INVESTMENT", "RECEITA ANO 1": "YEAR 1 REVENUE", "EBITDA ANO 1": "YEAR 1 EBITDA", "VAL DO PROJETO": "PROJECT NPV", "CAPEX + stock inicial": "CAPEX + opening stock", "conjunto": "combined", "Anos de concessao do conjunto": "Combined concession term", "Juro bancario": "Bank interest rate", "Imposto apos juros": "Tax after interest", "Divida final": "Closing debt balance", "O ganho adicional exclui falsas poupancas por mera redistribuicao de custos.": "Incremental gain excludes artificial savings from reallocating costs.", "As colunas das componentes incluem imputacao de custos comuns. Os impostos por componente sao analiticos; no conjunto assume-se uma unica entidade operacional. Ajuste de imposto operacional no ano 1:": "Component columns include allocated shared costs. Component taxes are analytical; the combined view assumes one operating entity. Year 1 operating tax adjustment:", "Mesma taxa de desconto de": "Same discount rate of", "para permitir comparacao.": "for comparison.", "Defina que parte das rubricas ja existentes na onda serve ambas as atividades. Sao reclassificadas, nao somadas novamente.": "Choose which existing wave costs support both activities. They are reclassified, not added a second time.", "Concession and financing are shared. The founder, investor and bank percentages set for the wave also apply to the additional investment.": "The same concession and funding structure applies to the additional investment.", "A coluna": "The column", "Seguro": "Insurance", "Produtos vendidos (CMVMC)": "Products sold (COGS)", "Pagamentos": "Payment fees", "Equipa exclusiva do bar": "Bar-only staff", "Renda exclusiva / encargo fixo": "Bar rent / fixed cost", "Outros exclusivos": "Other bar-only costs", "Ponto de equilibrio operacional": "Operating break-even", "Inclui custos comuns. Nao cobre impostos, divida ou recuperacao do investimento. O mix e o consumo medio sao mantidos constantes neste indicador.": "Includes shared costs. Excludes tax, debt and investment recovery. Customer mix and average spend remain unchanged in this metric.", "Surfers and companions generate": "Surfers and companions generate", "da receita do bar.": "of bar revenue.", "Inclui participantes de privadas; os dias de abertura sao considerados coincidentes ate ao menor numero de dias de cada mes. O horario mais curto reduz a exposicao proporcionalmente.": "Includes private-session participants. Operating days overlap up to the lower number of days in each month; shorter opening hours proportionally reduce exposure.", "Os clientes a trabalhar usam os mesmos lugares e permanecem mais tempo. O limite e aplicado por horas-lugar mensais; nao garante capacidade em horas de ponta.": "Working customers use the same seats and stay longer. Capacity is limited by monthly seat-hours and is not guaranteed at peak times.", "As visitas de trabalho sao limitadas primeiro aos seus lugares/janela, e as restantes origens partilham a capacidade residual proporcionalmente. Nao ha receita de cowork separada.": "Working visits are first capped by their seats and time window. Other customer sources share remaining capacity proportionally. There is no separate coworking revenue.", "Contabilidade da onda partilhada": "Shared wave accounting", "Marketing da onda partilhado": "Shared wave marketing", "Diversos da onda partilhados": "Shared wave other costs", "Quota do pool imputada ao bar": "Share of overhead allocated to the bar", "Defina que parte": "Set what share", "Vendas efetivas": "Tickets sold", "O valor total": "Total value", "Ano": "Year", "anos": "years", "€/mes": "€/month", "Média": "Average", "onda": "wave", "sessoes": "sessions", "sessoes.": "sessions.", "Horizonte de": "Horizon of", "anos, valor residual editavel, sem perpetuidade.": "years, editable residual value, no perpetuity.", "O stock inicial e recuperado ao valor contabilistico no fim; nao e depreciado e nao cresce. Precos liquidos de IVA, sem calendario de IVA, pre-abertura ou tesouraria intranual. Imposto simplificado sem reporte de prejuizos. Equipa do bar adicional; pessoal partilhado deve ser repartido manualmente para evitar duplicacoes. Eventos e pacotes da onda devem excluir consumo ja contabilizado no bar. O modelo nao presume mais vendas da onda por existir um bar.": "Opening stock is recovered at book value at exit; it is not depreciated or grown. Prices exclude VAT; no VAT timing, pre-opening costs or intra-year cash flow. Simplified tax with no loss carry-forward. Bar staff are additional; allocate shared staff manually to avoid duplication. Wave events and packages must exclude bar spend already counted. The model does not assume the bar increases wave sales.", "CAIXA E RETORNO": "CASH AND RETURNS", "Bar": "Bar", "Faturacao": "Revenue", "Vendas": "Sales", "Investimento total": "Total investment", "Saldo": "Balance", "Membros": "Members", "N.º": "No.", "Locais": "Sites", "Entrada": "Entry", "saida": "exit", "Limite": "Limit", "Tempo": "Time", "Percentagem": "Percentage", "Sem ": "Without ", "por dia": "per day", "dias": "days", "deste": "of this", "esta": "this", "Tambem": "Also", "inclui": "includes", "Indisponivel": "Unavailable", "Operacao": "Operations", "Investimento": "Investment", "Rendimento": "Income", "Alocacao": "Allocation", "Nao atinge na capacidade atual": "Not reached at current capacity"});
  Object.assign(text, {"Os valores iniciais servem para explorar a ideia e podem ser editados. O espaco para trabalhar faz parte do bar: nao ha passes, aluguer de postos ou mensalidades. Receita = consumo por visita. Os clientes a trabalhar nao entram novamente no publico externo.": "Starting values are editable placeholders. The work area is part of the bar: there are no passes, desk rentals or subscriptions. Revenue is spend per visit. Working customers are not counted again as external customers.", "TIR:": "IRR:", "Taxa de desconto de": "Discount rate of", "taxa de desconto": "discount rate", "Clientes a trabalhar nao entram novamente no publico externo.": "Working customers are not counted again as external customers.", "Antes da sazonalidade; exclui surfistas, acompanhantes e clientes a trabalhar": "Before seasonality; excludes surfers, companions and people working", "Incluidos nos lugares totais do bar, nao adicionais": "Included in total bar seats, not additional", "0% = procura uniforme; 100% = fatores mensais da onda": "0% = uniform demand; 100% = wave monthly seasonality factors", "Os dias de abertura sao considerados coincidentes": "Operating days are assumed to overlap", "nao ha passes, aluguer de postos ou mensalidades": "there are no passes, desk rentals or memberships", "Sem consumo da onda remove apenas surfistas e acompanhantes. Mantem os restantes clientes, capacidade e custos; nao e um orcamento para abrir um bar autonomo noutro local.": "Without wave-driven spend removes only surfers and companions. Other customers, capacity and costs remain; this is not a standalone bar budget for another location.", "O stock inicial e recuperado ao valor contabilistico no fim; nao e depreciado e nao cresce. Precos liquidos de IVA, sem calendario de IVA, pre-abertura ou tesouraria intranual. Imposto simplificado sem reporte de prejuizos. Equipa do bar adicional; pessoal partilhado deve ser repartido manualmente para evitar duplicacoes. Eventos e pacotes da onda devem excluir consumo ja contabilizado no bar. O modelo nao presume mais vendas da onda por existir um bar.": "Opening stock is recovered at book value at exit; it is not depreciated or grown. Prices exclude VAT; no VAT timing, pre-opening costs or intra-year cash flow. Simplified tax with no loss carry-forward. Bar staff are additional; allocate shared staff manually to avoid duplication. Wave events and packages must exclude bar spend already counted. The model does not assume the bar increases wave sales.", "As colunas das componentes incluem imputacao de custos comuns. Os impostos por componente sao analiticos; no conjunto assume-se uma unica entidade operacional. Ajuste de imposto operacional no ano 1:": "Component columns include allocated shared costs. Component taxes are analytical; the combined view assumes one operating entity. Year 1 operating tax adjustment:", "O ganho adicional exclui falsas poupancas por mera redistribuicao de custos.": "Incremental gain excludes artificial savings from reallocating costs.", "Concession and financing are shared. The founder, investor and bank percentages set for the wave also apply to the additional investment.": "The same concession and funding structure applies to the additional investment.", "Taxa de distribuicao": "Dividend payout rate", "meses": "months", "bar (imputacao analitica)": "bar (analytical allocation)", "Sem consumo da onda": "Without wave-driven spend", "Horas": "Hours", "Custo de material": "Equipment cost", "Caixa retida": "Retained cash", "Investidores externos": "External investors", "Preco minimo": "Minimum price", "Pessoa/sessao": "People/session", "Preparacao": "Preparation", "Atribuicao": "Allocation", "Evolucao": "Projection", "Fluxo de caixa": "Cash flow", "Equity": "Equity", "Rentabilidade": "Returns", "Investimento inicial": "Initial investment", "Tamanho": "Size", "Unidade": "Unit", "Principal": "Principal", "Anos": "Years", "Mês": "Month", "Mes": "Month", "A": "Year ", "Utilizacao": "Use", "energia": "energy", "Preço": "Price", "Energia": "Energy", "desconto": "discount", "procurada": "demanded", "procura": "demand", "Sessões": "Sessions", "Público": "Customers", "externo": "external", "Caixa e retorno —": "Cash and returns —", "Imposto apos juros": "Tax after interest", "Divida final": "Closing debt balance", "OPEX, incluindo custos comuns": "OPEX, including shared costs", "Horizonte de": "Horizon of", "anos, valor residual editavel, sem perpetuidade.": "years, editable residual value, no perpetuity."});
